{"id":"983eb8fcfa54aec4","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-back-and-forth-equivalence.md","title":"Back-and-Forth Equivalence Characterization","display":"thm-back-and-forth — Back-and-Forth Equivalence Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-back-and-forth-equivalence","aliases":["57-thm-back-and-forth-equivalence"],"display":"thm-back-and-forth — Back-and-Forth Equivalence Characterization","depends_on":["[[57-df-back-and-forth]]","[[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]","[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]","[[57-df-ef-game]]","[[57-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-back-and-forth-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-back-and-forth-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-back-and-forth — Back-and-Forth Equivalence Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ef176a8d804d79a\" href=\"?note=5ef176a8d804d79a\" title=\"57-df-back-and-forth\">57-df-back-and-forth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8928e339d0b9e54\" href=\"?note=c8928e339d0b9e54\" title=\"57-df-partial-isomorphism\">57-df-partial-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"238427f0df2ecaed\" href=\"?note=238427f0df2ecaed\" title=\"57-df-elementary-equivalence\">57-df-elementary-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"40a9587a80026ff4\" href=\"?note=40a9587a80026ff4\" title=\"57-df-ef-game\">57-df-ef-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b060448f50c005a8\" href=\"?note=b060448f50c005a8\" title=\"57-df-finite\">57-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Back-and-Forth-Characterization-of-Elementary-Equivalence\">Back-and-Forth Characterization of Elementary Equivalence</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"40a9587a80026ff4\" href=\"?note=40a9587a80026ff4\" title=\"57-df-ef-game\">57-df-ef-game</a> 的有限纯关系签名条件，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 为同签名结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartIso}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartIso}\\)</span>、原单向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BackAndForth}\">\\(\\mathrm{BackAndForth}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv\">\\(\\equiv\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c8928e339d0b9e54\" href=\"?note=c8928e339d0b9e54\" title=\"57-df-partial-isomorphism\">57-df-partial-isomorphism</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5ef176a8d804d79a\" href=\"?note=5ef176a8d804d79a\" title=\"57-df-back-and-forth\">57-df-back-and-forth</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"238427f0df2ecaed\" href=\"?note=238427f0df2ecaed\" title=\"57-df-elementary-equivalence\">57-df-elementary-equivalence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b060448f50c005a8\" href=\"?note=b060448f50c005a8\" title=\"57-df-finite\">57-df-finite</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> 是按剩余步数分层的部分同构族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^{-1}=\\{\\langle b,a\\rangle:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in p\\}\">\\(p^{-1}=\\{\\langle b,a\\rangle:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in p\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A\\equiv\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal I:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B))\\;[\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal I(n)\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathcal I(n)\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(p))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathcal I(n+1)\\;[\\mathrm{BackAndForth}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\mathrm{BackAndForth}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A,p^{-1})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;(p\\cup\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\}\\in\\mathcal I(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;(p\\cup\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\}\\in\\mathcal I(n))]].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A\\equiv\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal I:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B))\\;[\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal I(n)\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathcal I(n)\\;\\mathrm{Finite}(p))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathcal I(n+1)\\;[\\mathrm{BackAndForth}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\mathrm{BackAndForth}(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A,p^{-1})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;(p\\cup\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\}\\in\\mathcal I(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;(p\\cup\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\}\\in\\mathcal I(n))]].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限深度的扩展必须落回下一层获胜族；仅有每个 p_i 各自一步可扩展而无层间联系，不能推出初等等价。有限关系语言中，每个有限秩类型由有限公式决定，层族可取各剩余步数的获胜位置。此处不把初等等价错误地等同于任意可数结构之间存在一个无限穷尽同构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Back-and-Forth-Characterization-of-Elementary-Equivalence","text":"Back-and-Forth Characterization of Elementary Equivalence","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-back-and-forth","status":"resolved","id":"5ef176a8d804d79a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-back-and-forth]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c8928e339d0b9e54","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-elementary-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"238427f0df2ecaed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ef-game","status":"resolved","id":"40a9587a80026ff4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-ef-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"b060448f50c005a8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ef-game","status":"resolved","id":"40a9587a80026ff4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[57-df-ef-game]] 的有限纯关系签名条件，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 为同签名结构，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。$\\mathrm{PartIso}$、原单向 $\\mathrm{BackAndForth}$、$\\equiv$ 见 [[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]、[[57-df-back-and-forth]]、[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]。$\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[57-df-finite]]；$\\mathcal I$ 是按剩余步数分层的部分同构族，$p^{-1}=\\{\\langle b,a\\rangle:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in p\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c8928e339d0b9e54","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[57-df-ef-game]] 的有限纯关系签名条件，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 为同签名结构，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak 